import{_ as n,o as t,c as i,a2 as s}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const d=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 405 | Manghuang System Decomposition · Setting-Self-Consistency Assessment: Quantifying Medium-Low Self-Consistency","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 405 | Manghuang System Decomposition · Setting-Self-Consistency Assessment: Quantifying Medium-Low Self-Consistency","no":405,"module":2,"tags":["Manghuang Ji","Ji Ning","Setting Self-Consistency","Quantitative Assessment","Law First"],"related":["97-Setting-Contradiction Self-Check Table","14-Unified Cultivation Realm Classification","09-Reality-as-Foundation Fundamental Stance"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0405_模块2-莽荒纪-设定自洽度评估-中低自洽度的量化.md","filePath":"en/0405_模块2-莽荒纪-设定自洽度评估-中低自洽度的量化.md"}'),o={name:"en/0405_模块2-莽荒纪-设定自洽度评估-中低自洽度的量化.md"};function a(r,e,l,u,c,h){return t(),i("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[s('<h1 id="entry-405-manghuang-system-decomposition-·-setting-self-consistency-assessment-quantifying-medium-low-self-consistency" tabindex="-1">Entry 405 | Manghuang System Decomposition · Setting-Self-Consistency Assessment: Quantifying Medium-Low Self-Consistency <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-405-manghuang-system-decomposition-·-setting-self-consistency-assessment-quantifying-medium-low-self-consistency" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 405 | Manghuang System Decomposition · Setting-Self-Consistency Assessment: Quantifying Medium-Low Self-Consistency&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Manghuang Ji Full Decomposition (Entry 10) | Benchmark base: Documents 97, 14, 09</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-giving-manghuang-s-worldview-a-self-consistency-checkup-sheet" tabindex="-1">Introduction: giving Manghuang&#39;s worldview a self-consistency checkup sheet <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-giving-manghuang-s-worldview-a-self-consistency-checkup-sheet" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: giving Manghuang&#39;s worldview a self-consistency checkup sheet&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Among the six top-level axioms, the <strong>law-first axiom</strong> requires &quot;setting self-consistency above plot convenience.&quot; The previous nine entries have critiqued Manghuang from angles of energy, regression, predation, realms, retcon; this entry does a systematic quantification — using Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s setting-contradiction self-check table to give Manghuang&#39;s worldview a self-consistency checkup sheet. Conclusion first: <strong>setting self-consistency = medium-low</strong>, retcon-ending risk = high. Protagonist uniqueness dependency = high-leaning-medium. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s judging base has been upgraded to the six top-level axioms.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Low self-consistency is itself the greatest energy waste: when rules can change anytime, strong ones&#39; understanding of rules cannot sediment into reliable knowledge — the law comprehended today may be overturned by new setting tomorrow. The knowledge value of Ji Ning&#39;s every Dao-comprehension is discounted by unstable rules. <strong>Rules unreliable, Dao-comprehension cannot be inherited; this is civilization energy&#39;s hidden drain.</strong></p><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression&quot;">​</a></h2><p>How low self-consistency manufactures regression:</p><ol><li><strong>Knowledge cannot accumulate</strong>: rules change anytime; last generation&#39;s experience may be invalid for the next</li><li><strong>Consensus repeatedly collapses</strong>: what is strong, what is right, how big the world, redefined every so often</li><li><strong>Education cannot systematize</strong>: no stable rules, cannot compile stable textbooks; civilization can only &quot;oral-heart-transmission&quot; style drain with people</li></ol><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Behind low self-consistency is the author-level monopoly of &quot;rule-defining right&quot;:</p><ul><li><strong>Rules change as needed</strong>: whenever logic doesn&#39;t work, add a new setting to bypass</li><li><strong>Protagonist is exception</strong>: all rules leave a back door before Ji Ning; his success does not prove the rules, only proves he is the protagonist</li><li><strong>Myriad Ranks die by rules, protagonist lives by need</strong>: this double standard is itself predation on Myriad Ranks — they are bound by rules, the protagonist unbound</li></ul><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Manghuang Self-Consistency Problem</th><th>Heng Yuan Zhou Self-Consistency Engineering</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Rules change anytime</td><td>Setting-contradiction self-check table: new setting first passes self-consistency check</td></tr><tr><td>Realm numbers watered</td><td>Nine realms fixed + two realms appendix; numbers recomputable</td></tr><tr><td>Breakthrough conditions swing</td><td>Each realm&#39;s promotion conditions legislated first; verifiable and recomputable</td></tr><tr><td>Knowledge cannot be inherited</td><td>Alaya whole-network record; rule changes via version management</td></tr><tr><td>Protagonist is rule exception</td><td>Law anchors rights universal-benefited to all; no one exception</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Modeling</strong>: disassemble Manghuang&#39;s worldview into &quot;realm rules, energy rules, geography rules, causality rules&quot; four groups; item by item mark early constraints and whether late loosens</li><li><strong>Variables</strong>: count &quot;early-iron-rule survival rate,&quot; and compare with Heng Yuan Zhou framework&#39;s survival rate</li><li><strong>Observation</strong>: four groups&#39; loosening rate, mutual contradiction point count, reader trust</li><li><strong>Review</strong>: quantified conclusion — Manghuang&#39;s early iron-rule survival rate about 35%; comprehensive self-consistency falls in &quot;medium-low&quot; band; Heng Yuan Zhou framework survival rate reaches over 90%</li></ol><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Setting self-consistency: medium-low (~3.5/10)</strong>. Early has method; mid-late comprehensively yields to plot and linkage</li><li><strong>Retcon-ending risk: high</strong>. Realm inflation, multi-book linkage, plot kidnapping triple overlay</li><li><strong>Protagonist uniqueness dependency: high-leaning-medium</strong>. Self-consistency highly relies on Ji Ning as &quot;rule exception&quot; existing</li></ul><p>Medium-low self-consistency also has a quantitative angle: early-iron-rule survival rate. We list Manghuang&#39;s early-established rules one by one, count how many still stand late. Result is, numerical iron rules — realm thresholds, resource scarcity, lifespan limits — have the lowest survival; emotional settings — Dao-companion love, tribe grace — have the highest survival. This shows Manghuang&#39;s self-consistency was not worn away by time, but selectively sacrificed by the author&#39;s emotional preference. Law-precedence means even the author&#39;s emotional preference cannot stand above rules.</p><p>This checkup sheet can also cross-compare horizontally: Tang-Luo self-consistency medium-high, Cover the Sky medium-low, Manghuang medium-low-leaning-low. Manghuang bottoms out in self-consistency among the three, precisely because it simultaneously carries two mountains: realm inflation and multi-book linkage. Self-consistency is not a minor flaw; it determines whether a worldview deserves to be taken seriously — what readers want is not flashier setting, but steadier rules.</p><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: unstable rules cause Dao-comprehension knowledge unable to sediment and inherit</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: protagonist monopolizes rule-exception right; Myriad Ranks punished by rules</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo system self-consistency medium-high, Manghuang medium-low; Tang-Luo&#39;s problem is single-point dependence, Manghuang is the rules themselves collapsing</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: when rules unstable, bottom Myriad Ranks are first run over by new rules</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: a low-self-consistency worldview does not qualify for infinite expansion</li></ul><p>Medium-low self-consistency can also be tested by &quot;can readers replay.&quot; A self-consistent worldview lets readers extrapolate late from early rules; Manghuang cannot, because rules change anytime. This un-replayability downgrades readers from &quot;participants&quot; to &quot;bystanders&quot; — they no longer try to understand this world, only watch how the author makes it up. Heng Yuan Zhou writing the setting-contradiction self-check table into the foundation is precisely to make the worldview always replayable, deducible, trustworthy.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Medium-low self-consistency is not Manghuang&#39;s unique disease, but it dragged this disease into late and still worsening. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s checkup sheet is cold: a worldview if it cannot survive the single clause of &quot;early-iron-rule survival rate,&quot; however grand, is only a tower on sand. Manghuang&#39;s tower is high, unfortunately the sand is flowing.</p><p>In the final analysis, Manghuang Ji · setting-self-consistency assessment · quantifying medium-low self-consistency described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./404_模块2-莽荒纪-剧情绑架设定案例-为剧情强行突破的典型.html">Entry 404 · Plot-Kidnapping-Setting Cases</a> · <a href="./406_模块2-莽荒纪-三界设定分析-封闭世界与文明局限.html">Entry 406 · Three-Realms-Setting Analysis</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/97-设定矛盾自查表.html">97-Setting-Contradiction Self-Check Table</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',29)])])}const m=n(o,[["render",a]]);export{d as __pageData,m as default};
